lar rebellion?#{1}":[14,15],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 4 Prep##What does Dasgupta mean when he describes the sepoy mutinies as an \"assertion of autonomous power\" and how compatible is his characterisation of the Rebellion with Mukherjee's?":[16,19],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 4 Prep##What does Dasgupta mean when he describes the sepoy mutinies as an \"assertion of autonomous power\" and how compatible is his characterisation of the Rebellion with Mukherjee's?#{1}":[18,19],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 4 Prep##In responding to the hypothetical essay question (Were the rebelling sepoys part of a wider people's movement?) which possible responses or positions can you identify so far on the basis of this week's reading - and which do you find most compelling right now?":[20,22]},"outlinks":[]},"smart_blocks:Historian's Toolkit - Semester 1/Historians Toolkit Tutorial 4 Prep.md#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 4 Prep": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05166026,0.03327093,0.07793979,-0.05081828,-0.00856815,-0.0138128,0.04128534,0.01205581,-0.03189188,-0.02245442,-0.00970834,-0.05894677,0.00113976,0.03328752,-0.00398866,-0.04269032,-0.07381096,0.03686254,-0.02542249,0.03113872,0.04028669,-0.0125539,0.00839288,0.02631536,0.06421183,0.00366941,0.00085301,-0.07416977,-0.04514877,-0.22240013,0.01770828,-0.0080414,0.07944327,-0.02198827,0.00937726,0.00741493,0.01232227,0.06327263,0.03850493,0.02152404,-0.03131141,0.04009675,0.05628023,0.0281306,-0.04546394,-0.09441197,0.05824155,-0.01349045,-0.06476441,-0.01389471,0.02131918,0.00708075,-0.0030829,-0.03477731,0.05678343,0.02891152,0.07647543,0.08863309,0.03413186,-0.01072844,0.04484883,0.06688948,-0.23149708,0.04624443,0.06212031,-0.0270916,-0.00059665,0.01976002,0.0214486,0.03674669,-0.05975091,0.02636311,0.00843226,0.00609385,-0.01924744,-0.01860195,0.01401237,-0.01663674,-0.03906476,-0.06696395,0.05826806,0.10153344,0.03467378,-0.04655045,-0.07025424,-0.07367106,0.05420182,-0.09258591,0.00460142